DBG-QUALITY raw {"q":"What commission does a partner earn on a renewal invoice, and what does an account rep earn on a renewal?","searches":[{"query":"partner commission renewal invoice"},{"query":"account executive account rep commission renewal"}],"rawFinal":"Partners earn 10% of renewal invoices while the customer remains active and the partner agreement is current.\n\nThe commission applies to the invoiced ACV of registered partner deals: 10% of the annual invoice for the first year, and 10% of renewal invoices while the customer remains active and the partner agreement is current. [1]\n\nAn account rep earns 4% of ACV on renewals.\n\nRenewals and expansion (additional seats or modules on an existing account) pay 4% of ACV. [3]","grounded":"A citation in the draft answer did not match evidence retrieved in this turn, so the answer was refused.","ev":[["[1]","nw_sales_partner_program","Partner Commissions and Payouts"],["[2]","nw_finance_invoicing_payment","Invoicing for Partners and Resellers"],["[3]","nw_sales_commission_plan","Commission Rates"],["[4]","nw_sales_commission_plan","Relationship to Other Policies"],["[5]","nw_sales_partner_program","Partner Pricing"],["[6]","nw_sales_partner_program","Relationship to Other Policies"],["[7]","nw_sales_partner_program","Partner Lifecycle"],["[8]","nw_sales_referral_program","Relationship to Other Policies"],["[9]","nw_sales_territory_assignment","Account Transfers"],["[10]","nw_sales_territory_assignment","Relationship to Other Policies"],["[11]","nw_sales_commission_plan","Purpose and Confidentiality"],["[12]","nw_sales_territory_assignment","Assignment Rules"]]}
